    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nI am currently using mini.files plugin. When i delete files, i want it move it to my trash can. I have tried to pass in the correct options for this, but it doesn't seem to be working.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire \"mini.files\".setup({\r\n  options = {\r\n\t  permanent_delete = false,\r\n  }\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nAm i missing something here?",
    "closed_at": "2024-02-09T15:16:09Z",
