    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The [`config.options.permanent_delete` indicates whether to perform permanent delete or move into **special** trash directory](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/16600082b7b3e3ee3aa3d59f2bc589fc60ffcada/doc/mini-files.txt#L602-L606). That trash directory is not the same as system trash because moving files into system trash is not entirely trivial.\r\n\r\nIf you have deleted files after permanent delete was disabled, the files should be present in 'mini.files/trash' subdirectory of \"data\" standard path.",
